                                "sense_id": "ee50749b-0d21-3463-a87f-9181ad8eb75e",
                                "text": "[...] that is my lord and uncle King Arthur, for he is full straitly bestood [sore beset] with a false traitor, which is my half brother Sir Mordred, [...]"
