                                "sense_id": "edf40ec9-a3d5-320a-b014-405215e18f65",
                                "text": "Wherefore the Brittishe bisshops, bestood with weapons and enemies, when thei coulde not execute all functions, and perceaved that the prelates their neighbours weare prompte to assiste them, [...]"
