                                "sense_id": "e4bd2932-239d-35f1-af32-df4c2c54ad9c",
                                "text": "[...] and, inherited Puritan crust of stiffness that rarely left him, and which bestood him well under the ceremonials of his mission, whether at London (1846- 49) or later (1867-74) in Berlin."
